sk, 1812</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Borodino, 1812</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beresina, 1812</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vitoria, 1813</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >L\u00fctzen, 1813</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bautzen, 1813</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leipzig, 1813</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Montmirail, 1814</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vauchamps, 1814</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Montereau, 1814</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Paris, 1814</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ligny, 1815</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waterloo, 1815</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And two secret fictitious battles.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>The AI</u></strong>\u00a0will throughout this present a formidable challenge. Innovative mechanics allow it for example to  intelligently evade flanking maneuvers or countercharge when charged. On lower difficulties these behaviours are tuned down or removed. The AI employs a Corps System to utilize or defend against strategies like defeat in detail, distraction attacks, defense in depth etc...  The AI has no cheat bonuses or maluses on any difficulty level.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715460/extras/81f4847881daecbfd9701596807ef635.poster.avif?t=1754075119\" width=616 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715460/extras/81f4847881daecbfd9701596807ef635.webm?t=1754075119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sour