hem. In melee brawls realistic clusters form. During rain muskets don\u2019t function. Blizzards make your soldiers tire out faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715460/extras/958aae2eda8238fc1da4e3c1c74b2a45.poster.avif?t=1754075119\" width=616 height=370 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715460/extras/958aae2eda8238fc1da4e3c1c74b2a45.webm?t=1754075119\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715460/extras/958aae2eda8238fc1da4e3c1c74b2a45.mp4?t=1754075119\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Soldiers step to the side to let a friendly elite unit through to the front.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The fate of France hangs in the balance.  Take command of the legendary <strong>Grande</strong> <strong>Arm\u00e9e</strong>, shape the destiny of Europe and experience the ultimate Napoleonic simulation.</p>",
